[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4008616067","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116894#issuecomment-4008616067","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116894","id":4008616067,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7u7qCD","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T00:13:31Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T00:16:23Z","body":"Very strange, all this does is look through the registered interfaces, and if one is initialised, calls process on that.\n\nWith nothing initialised, this shouldn't result in any big performance hit?\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/xr/xr_server.cpp#L460\n\n**edit** and note that on iOS we will only have 1 registered interface, which is the MobileVRInterface. So it loops through 1 entry... ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4008616067/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4009176603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116894#issuecomment-4009176603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116894","id":4009176603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7u9y4b","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T02:43:28Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T02:43:28Z","body":"On MacOS (which is where this was profiled), it consumes 10% of the idle time processing:\n\n<img width=\"1458\" height=\"270\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ed3f391-643d-4930-94e4-35291f1ab23d\" />\n\nDepending on where I scan, this is 10% of 2%-4% up to 50% of 2% of CPU usage when idling:\n\n<img width=\"2245\" height=\"1069\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0378ae85-8378-4487-a05a-26d44166be18\" />\n\nIf you look at [the original case, ](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116845#issuecomment-3973954492) you will see that the challenge is with the cumulating waste of about 10-12 of these, which quickly adds up.   It turns out that what passed as an unresolved mystery was just a snowball of these: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/68269\n\n(btw, this does not personally affect me, as on iOS for Xogot I just turned it off entirely - this is about Godot on every other platform).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4009176603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4093307808","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116894#issuecomment-4093307808","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116894","id":4093307808,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7z-uug","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T21:09:24Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T21:09:24Z","body":"@migueldeicaza Does the profile look the same after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117178? That PR should make `XRServer::_process()` even lighter\n\nIn the case of MacOS, I'd expect there to only be two `XRInterface`s: `MobileVRInterface` and `OpenXRInterface`. And, assuming neither is initialized, the most costly thing there should be the virtual function dispatch of calling `is_initialized()` on each of them (and in both cases, they just return a bool variable - no actual logic)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4093307808/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]